      "body": "## Motivation\n\nOn MI355X (gfx950), SGLang rejects ModelOpt FP8 checkpoints such as `nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-FP8` with `modelopt_fp8 quantization is currently not supported in ROCm.` Once allowed, Nemotron-H's automatic MoE runner choice picks `flashinfer_cutlass`, which ROCm does not have.\n\n## Modifications\n\nAllow `modelopt_fp8` on gfx95, and pick the Triton MoE runner for Nemotron-H ModelOpt FP8 on HIP when the runner is `auto`.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n`nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-FP8` on two MI355X GPUs (TP2) scores 95.45% on the full GSM8K set, versus 95.15% for the BF16 model.\n\nCo-author-with: @JessicaJiang-123\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41587588218](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41587588218)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41587588122](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41587588122)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41587588190](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41587588190)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
